## ✅ Pre-Implementation Checklist

Before implementing any feature, verify:
- [ ] Confidence ≥90% (use ConfidenceChecker if uncertain)
- [ ] Checked official docs (Pytest, Click, etc.)
- [ ] Understood project structure (see PLANNING.md)
- [ ] Considered security implications
- [ ] Planned tests (unit + integration)
- [ ] Checked for similar existing implementations
- [ ] Using UV for all Python commands

## 🎯 When Uncertain

**Confidence < 70%**: Ask clarifying questions
**Confidence 70-89%**: Present 2-3 approaches with tradeoffs
**Confidence ≥90%**: Proceed with implementation

**For technical questions**:
1. Check official docs (via Context7 MCP if available)
2. Search existing codebase
3. Review PLANNING.md and KNOWLEDGE.md
4. Ask user for clarification

